  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2026-07-01T12:34:30-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, July 1, 2026, 12:34 pm\">July 1, 2026</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists’ seasonal Art-in-the-Park  has again returned to Doane Park in Harwich Port.  The Guild was founded in 1979 when local artists who had been gathering in the park for several years incorporated our non-profit guild dedicated to art and the community.  The 10-week season runs every Monday (weather permitting) between 10am and 4pm. through August 31st.  Artists offering include original fine art, prints and juried fine crafts.  The popular face painting tent is a must stop for the young of heart. <img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7434\" src=\"/media/archive/30e21fe958f7e9adaa0f9e47f04ed9648574c5f584cf58f2a3818686e71f7fee.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7435\" src=\"/media/archive/9104f4161df91226dc34e6c67430305f153c088b4974e21046fd391920770a58.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
